<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI3138-HERMES-WHEEL-PACKAGING-GAP>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI3138-HERMES-WHEEL-PACKAGING-GAP" ;
  triage:title "Installed atm-graft wheel omits both Hermes Python modules" ;
  triage:description "arch-ctm's read-only AI3138-HERMES-HARNESS-REVIEW-1 (finding 1/4, CRITICAL) reports that crates/atm-graft-python/pyproject.toml:1-12 named only the native module atm_graft with no Python source/package configuration. PR #697 (5110791d) fixed 3 of 4 occurrences (maturin config, CI PYTHONPATH shim, test_hermes_adapter.py shim). AI3138-WHEEL-PACKAGING-QA-1 (PR #697 @ cbdc4430) verdict: FAIL, 1/4 deliverables (25%). ruthless-boundary-qa confirmed occurrence 4 remains open: crates/atm-graft-python/tests/hermes_steer_fixture.py:18 still sys.path.insert-shims the checked-in source and is imported by the sprint's own merge-gating proof script (scripts/phase-ai/run-hermes-steer-smoke.py), so the documented gate never exercises the real wheel. quality-mgr independently discovered a 5th, more severe occurrence: all 3 CI Test legs (ubuntu/macos/windows-latest) on PR #697 are RED because maturin build hard-fails with a python-source-is-set error, since the python module at the expected path does not exist -- pyproject.toml sets python-source to python with module-name atm_graft, but atm_graft is a native PyO3 extension with no pure-Python package dir at that path; only the two Hermes packages exist there. This fails inside .just/run_hermes_graft_bridge_tests.py's own maturin build step -- the exact wheel-build proof this PR was meant to add. rust-qa-agent's earlier local PASS is explained by a stale/cached local maturin or target/ build masking what a clean CI checkout hits as a hard error." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:category "packaging" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-graft-python/" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-30T22:05:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AI3138-WHEEL-PACKAGING-QA-1 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-07-30T21:59:49Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
